%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: SocialTips
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _sameOptionTarget: 2
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well, I suppose it'd be community service to help her out. I'd
      almost feel bad if I didn't at least try.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: If I may, Jessi. Perhaps I could offer you some advice to live
      your life to its intended potential?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 051809b70c0d48749b41aef782cb1ee0, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You... wanna help me?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Why, of course. I wouldn't just leave a poor soul like you all
      alone to fend for yourself like this. Sometimes all one needs is a little support.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5224f552d979b7d4c8e988245cdd9575, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Gee, thanks, I guess. Your fancy talk's especially strong today,
      wow.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8fadb01c20afe834da1f4899841afc76, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Alright, whatever, not like I really have anything better to do
      other than packing my shit and leaving. Lay it on me.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: With pleasure.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: My first piece of advice to you is to tone down that ego of yours.
      Might seem easier than done, but it's of utmost priority if you're to get along
      with anyone else.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: No one likes someone who's always as arrogant as you; a respectable
      person knows how much they actually matter to the world and acts accordingly.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4bb070eb7f25b4d43b4cd5ca28562347, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Soooo you're saying I'm some sort of narcissist or whatever?
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Mm, if you want to call it that, then I suppose so.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Okay, that already doesn't make sense. How am *I* a narcissist???
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Haven't you seen all the idiots around me!!! Is it my fault for
      having standards for them???
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I believe there's a fatal misunderstanding at play here.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Your perception of the world is very distorted, to the point where
      you feel like you are the only sane one walking this earth.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: However, you couldn't be more incorrect.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: The reason why all your interactions have failed thus far is not
      an external problem, but rather internal.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You always seek some sort of enjoyment or benefit for yourself
      out of every conversation you have, but that's not what the world intended
      for you.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Rather, your conversations are not meant to be enjoyable for you
      at all. At least, not in the manner that you're looking for.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: You simply have to let these conversations come and go without
      letting your expectations get in the way. You work with what you get, and that's
      all there is to it.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Okay\u2014so if I'm supposed to just let people run their mouths
      at me and not give them any piece of my mind, what else is there for me to
      do???"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Just sit there, listen, and nod like some sort of robot???
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85e73fbc318d21e4db7461e9136fd8c7, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Impressive. You've beaten me to my point.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: That practice is precisely what you should exercise. Listening
      to others and keeping your inferior thoughts to yourself is the best that you
      can do.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c5a4eab48d0d997458a6e0e15d1ce34c, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "'In-fee-ree-yur' bleh, bleh, bleh, what kind of advice is that????
      That sounds stupid as\u2014"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Ah-ah-ah. Hold that thought. Why don't you start applying that
      practice now?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e5765cb552eb0e743b1d025dd7e12a90, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Wh\u2014"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7221be3902993e49920b17cf290b8cb, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Anyway. Getting rid of your unwarranted ego will do wonders for
      your listening skills, as it'll get rid of all that clutter in your brain convincing
      you to act pretentiously.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d5bfc11db4b6324d85fdd72f11891ad, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Besides, others know better than you do. Wouldn't you agree that
      listening to those wiser than you only results in benefit?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 1
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "B-better?? The fuck\u2014"
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'You''re already doing well with the position you''ve chosen:
      working as a server. Taking orders like this is good reinforcement for the
      social conventions you should adhere to.'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0cbf25f7256b5034e9498573542f4e76, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'My second piece of advice: don''t be so picky with the attention
      you receive.'
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: That kind of selectiveness only makes people dislike you even
      further, especially if it's coming from someone like you.
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Someone who doesn't even have the privilege to pick and choose
      who interacts with them should not be speaking on who's "worth their time."
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: 'If anything, the fact that you can get interactions like this
      is pure luck. '
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: So instead of being critical of your social blunders, be grateful
      that the opportunity even came to you in the first place.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well? Did you find any of that helpful?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 264ba0fd55f3f0d40aa0a3d014011923, type: 3}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: ... I guess I got nothing to lose if I try it... I dunno.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: I feel like what you said mostly applies to the new people I meet
      here, though.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: What do I do about the people I already know? Aren't they gonna
      know something's up and figure me out??
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: And what about my life outside of just talking to people? How
      the hell do I fix that??
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _maxFriendship: 0
    _dialogueLine: "Hmm\u2026 with the time I'm allotted, I'll only be able to address
      one of those concerns."
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - _choiceType: 2
    _optionText: Address her existing relationships
  - _choiceType: 2
    _optionText: Address how she's been taking care of herself
  _npcReplies:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26077efd7e7990540b619eaec8301022, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: cdf18fb57801b2544b2f365417b6db77, type: 2}
  _gameEnd: 0
